      "kind": "registered",
      "label": "20日平均日内波动",
      "aliases": [
        "20日平均日内波动"
      ],
      "definition_notes": [
        "只对应登记对象 research.price_volume.range_mean20@1.0.0；此处展示已封存历史研究证据，不提供今天的读数。",
        "另接入沪深300ETF（510300.SS）2026-06-30的一条回溯观察；不能代表当前值或当时已经可得。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "docs/experiments/price-volume-range-mean20-eight-etf-2026-10-04.md",
          "sha256": "eea974e387f9507d5b3e293d74f9c16bfee615184be253abfd1edbab38d4732f"
